# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
# D-Bus activation of the app under its own application ID, installed in
# share/dbus-1/services and named after that ID. When the app is not running,
# a request to its bus name (a notification action, `gapplication launch`)
# starts it as a GApplication service, which opens a window only when asked.
# It never claims org.freedesktop.FileManager1: that stays the opt-in
# per-user file of "Show in folder" (native/packaging/README.md).
[D-BUS Service]
Name=@APP_ID@
Exec=@COMMAND@ --gapplication-service
